Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Caught off Guard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 10
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think we can really defeat that monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry I found a way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.47,0:00:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When I return to the city, I will tame that monster with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The king is so majestic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.35,0:00:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Still have to rely on Father
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The king is so powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.63,0:00:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.71,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Father
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you’re going in the wrong direction
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, Your Highness, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.03,0:01:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, where are you? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you? He shouldn’t have gone into the forest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,that is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Found His Highness Prince Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I read that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.96,0:01:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The one in front of His Highness seems to be His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,is true
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.79,0:01:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is alive
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.84,0:01:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I want to see it too
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This trip is truly a double blessing, Master Quan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.91,0:01:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don’t you hurry up and greet them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.49,0:01:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,obey
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.40,0:02:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally came out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.48,0:02:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.05,0:02:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, it’s great that Your Majesty is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.60,0:02:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,when Your Majesty was not around
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters were always harassing us and grabbing our Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bulala Kingdom cannot live without Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has been wronged
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.40,0:02:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This time I come back and I will definitely solve the monster problem
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.61,0:02:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It is that monster
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.74,0:02:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it suddenly come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster you are talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.41,0:02:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out it is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.15,0:03:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out to be so cute
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.39,0:03:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It was too dark to see clearly before
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know this monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.27,0:03:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be afraid, everyone, soldiers listen to my orders
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, take care of yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Cutie, look over here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,that is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to grassland craft class
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us teach you how to make a toy stick in one second
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:04:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just need a rope
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and my bell
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie and Wolffy’s special toy stick completed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,learned
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No Little Cutie can say no to this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster seems to have become docile
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.87,0:04:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it suddenly get angry again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.71,0:04:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:05:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel like this monster is targeting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, run quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.66,0:05:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s use the same rhythm of cooperation we used on the mountain to control the monster together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone come together
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll come
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Shrink
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this monster because you have beaten it before, Father
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So it came here specifically to take revenge on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it’s not that simple
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is right. It may not be that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie what are you going to do
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t go near it alone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, there is transparent wool controlling the Little Cutie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.07,0:07:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe after we cut that thread
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster will return to normal
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me to cut the line
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Saw it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You continue
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,let me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, give me a helping hand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.34,0:08:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,final blow
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be afraid. It’s okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. Father
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay, it’s okay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally solved the monster problem
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But what’s going on with this line?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was controlling the Little Cutie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,let me take a look
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.80,0:09:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This kind of line
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you are nearby
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.28,0:09:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, Brother
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.71,0:10:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It was actually discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder, it’s you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.28,0:10:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You were afraid that the thread would be revealed, so you ran away at that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, why would you do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you won’t do this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any difficulties?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,what I did
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,is just to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,take back what belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This powerful energy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How could Uncle become so powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The power gap is too big. Let’s escape first and then talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about escaping
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.96,0:11:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.79,0:11:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Run quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.66,0:12:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
